    *Level 1: 2 explosions, 40 damage.
    *Level 2: 4 explosions, 80 damage.
    *Level 3: 8 explosions, 160 damage.
Ready Aim Fire: (QCFx2 + y)
    *Requires 2 bars of energy.
    *Can be Super Canceled into.

